<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89019" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεκτέον</span></b> , (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσέχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>one must
				apply</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν νοῦν ἡμῖν αὐτοῖς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Men.</u>
					96d
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Isoc.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>: abs., <i>one must attend</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span> to a thing, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Demod.</u>
				384e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.119
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.64.2
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σοφοκλεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Phoc.</u>
					1
				</span></i>
			; <i>one must notice</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πῶς . . </span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>in Nic.</u>
					p.69
				</span></i>
			 P. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must agree with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Str.
				7.3.6
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσεκτέος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
					<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, <i>to be taken
				into consideration</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. οἱ
			τρόποι</span> Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				332.22
			</span></i>.</div>
